# No AI contributors

This repository must never show AI agents as GitHub contributors.

When creating git commits:

- Never use `git commit --author=...`
- Never set `GIT_AUTHOR_*` or `GIT_COMMITTER_*` environment variables
- Never add `Co-authored-by:` trailers for Cursor, Composer, Copilot, Devin, or any AI/bot
- Never use agent, bot, cursor, copilot, or noreply AI email addresses
- Always commit with the repository owner's configured git identity only

Repository enforcement:

- Git hooks in `.githooks/` validate author/committer against `.githooks/allowed-authors`
- Run `scripts/setup-git-hooks.sh` after clone to enable hooks

If the user asks you to commit, use normal `git commit` with no author overrides.
